Dropped collection / auth [opencollection.yml]: the NTLM workstation has no counterpart
Converted collection / auth.password [opencollection.yml]: the value is kept as the secret variable `ntlm_password`, not in the file
Converted Own Auth / request.auth.password [Own Auth.yml]: the value is kept as the secret variable `own_auth_password`, not in the file
Converted imported credentials [environments/Environment.yml]: the imported credentials are the secret variables `ntlm_password`, `own_auth_password`; their values are kept in the secret store, not in the file
== Own Auth.yml
info:
  name: Own Auth
  type: http
  seq: 2

http:
  method: GET
  url: http://localhost:3000/health
  auth:
    type: ntlm
    username: NTLM_USER_2
    password: "{{own_auth_password}}"
    domain: ""

settings:
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: inherit
  followRedirects: true
  maxRedirects: 5
  forwardAuthorizationHeader: false
== environments/Environment.yml
name: Environment
variables:
  - secret: true
    name: ntlm_password
  - secret: true
    name: own_auth_password
== opencollection.yml
opencollection: 1.0.0

info:
  name: NTLM

request:
  auth:
    type: ntlm
    username: NTLM_user
    password: "{{ntlm_password}}"
    domain: example.com
bundled: false
extensions:
  bruno:
    ignore:
      - node_modules
      - .git
